{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0FuaW1hdGlvbi8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvT25lJTIwUGllY2UlMjElMjAlMjgxOTk5JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"One Piece!","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/g8PBdpbVkF3nOeL2bbAEjljuKF9.jpg","description":"Made under the restrictions of \"no zoom, pan, editing or post-sound\", directors Shinobu Yaguchi and Takuji Suzuki skewer Japanese social conventions in 14 short episodes. In one segment a woman misreads an advertisement and arrives at a job interview dressed in a bunny suit. Another concerns a woman who hides to surprise her friends only to overhear their unkind appraisal of her hygiene. And another entitled \"Grandpa from Hell\" is a surreal yarn about a cult leader. Ranging from the humorous to the deeply bizarre, the film's static, minimalistic style makes such \"Dogme 95\" films as The Celebration (1998) look extravagant.\n\nReleased 20 Sept 1999 · Japan · Language: Japanese · 95 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: Japanese","releaseInfo":"1999","genres":["Comedy","Animation"],"imdbRating":"5.8","runtime":"95 min","cast":["Yoji Tanaka","Satoru Jitsunashi","Nao Nekota","Naomi Nishida"],"director":["Takuji Suzuki","Shinobu Yaguchi"],"released":"1999-09-20T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Takuji Suzuki","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fUOVWR3upxekGxSK533cLLsKGiZ.jpg"},{"name":"Yoji Tanaka","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/752oL9YrUumjrqbhdj4GNJ938x3.jpg"},{"name":"Satoru Jitsunashi","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6s5UH6PFa9dQBOH1AGxcBEcZyAp.jpg"},{"name":"Nao Nekota","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jx4w2VdY662xeUXFsBHewckSGGS.jpg"},{"name":"Naomi Nishida","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/oO9MWTZfBOKpFPuwWMiHFH9ksDJ.jpg"}]},"country":"Japan","language":"Japanese","links":[{"name":"Yoji Tanaka","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Yoji%20Tanaka"},{"name":"Satoru Jitsunashi","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?sear